## 11. ACCOUNT LEVEL-UP FEATURE
An account level-up feature may be introduced in a future update.

For the initial version, do not display the feature in the user dashboard or navigation.

The system should be designed so the feature can be introduced in a future update without rebuilding the entire website.

Any future account upgrade requirements, benefits, and costs must be disclosed clearly when the feature launches.

